BT /F1 11 Tf 48 648 Td (Inventory records a rejected reservation and produces StockRejected without deducting) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 632 Td (stock. This is an expected business outcome. It does not need retries or a dead-letter) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 616 Td (topic. The dashboard eventually shows the rejected status.) Tj ET
