BT /F1 11 Tf 48 548 Td (publisher to retry. If Inventory is unavailable, Kafka retains events for processing) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 532 Td (after it returns, subject to retention. Orders can remain pending during recovery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 516 Td (Monitoring pending outbox age and consumer lag would be important in production.) Tj ET
