BT /F2 13 Tf 48 468 Td (committed?) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 446 Td (Kafka may deliver the record again. The committed inbox marker lets the consumer) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 430 Td (recognize that the SQL effects already succeeded and avoid applying them twice. If SQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 414 Td (fails before commit, the marker and effects roll back and the retry can safely attempt) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 48 398 Td (the work again.) Tj ET
